This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is the MUTATION BATTERY behind the shard protocol of the shipped `ledger-reverify` fixture
(BL-406): it copies core's own sources and that fixture into temp trees, re-deals the copy small,
breaks one protocol arm at a time (J0, J1, J2, the unit floor, the shared-control count) and
requires the fixture to go red on exactly that arm. Every verdict is a question about whether THIS
repository's fixture still discriminates, which a consumer cannot act on, and shipping it would put
a unit into the consumer's suite schedule that tests nothing of theirs.
